### Create Product — happy path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: acme

{
  "code": "messaging",
  "name": "Messaging API",
  "description": "Messaging platform"
}

### Create Product — no description (optional field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: acme

{
  "code": "analytics",
  "name": "Analytics API"
}

### Create Product — duplicate code, same tenant (expects 409 PRODUCT_ALREADY_EXISTS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: acme

{
  "code": "messaging",
  "name": "Messaging API Duplicate",
  "description": "Should be rejected"
}

### Create Product — same code, different tenant (expects 201 — tenant isolation check)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: demo

{
  "code": "messaging",
  "name": "Messaging API (demo tenant)",
  "description": "Same code as acme's product, different tenant — must succeed"
}

### Create Product — missing code (expects 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: acme

{
  "name": "No Code Product"
}

### Create Product — blank name (expects 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: acme

{
  "code": "no-name",
  "name": ""
}

### Create Product — missing X-Tenant-Id header (expects 400 TENANT_MISSING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "no-tenant",
  "name": "No Tenant Product"
}

### Create Product — unknown tenant (expects 401 TENANT_UNKNOWN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: does-not-exist

{
  "code": "ghost",
  "name": "Ghost Product"
}

### List Products — default paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### List Products — explicit page/size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=0&size=5
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### List Products — sorted by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sort=name,asc
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### List Products — tenant isolation check (demo tenant should NOT see acme's products)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
X-Tenant-Id: demo

### Get Product — by code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/messaging
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Get Product — unknown code (expects 404 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/does-not-exist
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Get Product — tenant isolation: demo also has a "messaging" product (created above).
### Must return demo's own row (name "Messaging API (demo tenant)"), not acme's.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/messaging
X-Tenant-Id: demo
